<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Install/Upgrade: Adobe Reader XI 11.0.06 - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P><STRONG><FONT size=3>About Adobe Reader</FONT></STRONG></P>
<BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr>
<P>Adobe Reader&nbsp;is an&nbsp;application developed by Adobe Systems to view and&nbsp;print files in portable document format (PDF). Adobe's solution for creating and manipulating PDF files is Adobe Acrobat Professional, which requires a license.</P></BLOCKQUOTE>
<P><FONT color=#0080ff size=3><STRONG>Licensing</STRONG></FONT></P>
<BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr>
<P>Adobe Reader is freeware.</P></BLOCKQUOTE><STRONG>
<P><FONT size=3>About This Task</FONT></P></STRONG>
<BLOCKQUOTE>This task will install/upgrade: Adobe Reader XI 11.0.6<BR><BR>This task is applicable on: Windows XP and higher (32-bit and 64-bit)</BLOCKQUOTE>
<P><FONT size=3><STRONG>Action Description</STRONG></FONT></P>
<UL><FONT size=2>
<LI><FONT size=2><STRONG>Action1: Install/upgrade.</STRONG></FONT></LI></UL>
<BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr>
<P><FONT size=2>This action installs Reader. </FONT></P></BLOCKQUOTE>
<UL dir=ltr>
<LI>
<DIV><FONT size=2><STRONG>Action2: Install/upgrade and disable auto-updates.</STRONG></FONT></DIV></LI></UL>
<BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr>
<P><FONT size=2>This action installs Reader and then disables the automatic check for&nbsp;updates.</FONT></P></BLOCKQUOTE>
<UL>
<LI><FONT size=2>
<P dir=ltr><FONT size=2><STRONG>Action3: Install/upgrade only if</STRONG>&nbsp;<STRONG>Reader is not running.</STRONG></FONT></P></FONT></LI></UL>
<BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr>
<P dir=ltr><FONT size=2>This action only installs Reader if it is not running; if it is running, the action may report back as failed. To ensure that the update is eventually applied, you may to deploy this action as a policy and and retry the installation if it fails.</FONT></P></BLOCKQUOTE>
<UL dir=ltr>
<LI>
<DIV><FONT size=2><STRONG>Action4: Install/upgrade only if Reader is not running and disable auto-updates.</STRONG></FONT></DIV></LI></UL>
<BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr>
<P dir=ltr><FONT size=2>This action performs the same action as Action3 and then disables the automatic check for updates.</FONT></P></BLOCKQUOTE>
<UL dir=ltr>
<LI>
<DIV><FONT size=2><STRONG>Action5: Install/upgrade regardless of whether or not Reader&nbsp;is currently running.</STRONG></FONT></DIV></LI></UL>
<BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr>
<P dir=ltr><FONT size=2>This action installs Reader regardless of whether or not it is running. Use this action to ensure that the update is applied when the action is deployed.</FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=2><STRONG><FONT color=#ff0000>Important note:</FONT> </STRONG>This action will close any running instance of Reader on the client machines. Please schedule the update to occur at a time when a service interruption is acceptable.</FONT></P></BLOCKQUOTE>
<UL dir=ltr>
<LI>
<DIV><FONT size=2><STRONG>Action6: Install/upgrade regardless of whether or not Reader is currently running and disable auto-updates.</STRONG></FONT></DIV></LI></UL>
<BLOCKQUOTE style="MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px" dir=ltr>
<P dir=ltr><FONT size=2>This action performs the same action as Action5 and then disables the automatic check for&nbsp;updates.</FONT></P></BLOCKQUOTE>
<P dir=ltr><FONT color=#000000 size=3><STRONG>Additional&nbsp;Notes</STRONG></FONT></P>
<BLOCKQUOTE>
<P>By default, Actions1-6 do not&nbsp;install a desktop shortcut. To perform the action with a&nbsp;desktop shortcut, do the following:</P>
<UL>
<LI>Take the normal action you want to take (e.g., <EM>Install/upgrade</EM>, <EM>Install/upgrade if not running</EM>, etc.)
<LI>Select the "Action Script" tab
<LI>Select "Use the following action script"
<LI><STRONG>UNCOMMENT</STRONG> the <STRONG>wait</STRONG> statement under the&nbsp;<FONT color=#008000 face="Courier New">//install Adobe Reader&nbsp;WITH a desktop shortcut</FONT> comment.
<LI><STRONG>COMMENT</STRONG> the <STRONG>wait</STRONG> statement under the <FONT color=#008000 face="Courier New">//install Adobe Reader&nbsp;WITHOUT a desktop shortcut</FONT>&nbsp;comment.&nbsp;</LI></UL></BLOCKQUOTE></FONT>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>/* Windows Only */ windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[/* Windows XP or Higher */ version of operating system >= "5.1"]]></Relevance>
    <Relevance>/* Exclude Windows Server */ exists name whose(it does not contain &quot;Win2&quot;) of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[not exists key whose (value "DisplayName" of it as string contains "Adobe Reader" AND (it >= "11.0.06" as version) of (value "DisplayVersion" of it as string as version)) of key "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall" of x32 registry]]></Relevance>
    <Category>Software Sharing</Category>
    <Source>SysMan</Source>
    <SourceID>jgs194</SourceID>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2014-01-24</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
      <Name>x-fixlet-source</Name>
      <Value>Software Distribution Wizard</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <MIMEField>
      <Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
      <Value>Fri, 24 Jan 2014 17:00:07 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink></PreLink>
        <Link>Install/upgrade</Link>
        <PostLink>&amp;nbsp;and disable auto-updates.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell"><![CDATA[//download the Adobe Reader installer
prefetch AdbeRdr_en_US.exe sha1:6a3d5b494b4ed6e11fc7d917afc03eaf05d4a6aa size:50837888 http://ardownload.adobe.com/pub/adobe/reader/win/11.x/11.0.06/en_US/AdbeRdr11006_en_US.exe

//uninstall previous version of Adobe Reader
if  { exists key "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\{AC76BA86-7AD7-1033-7B44-AB0000000001}}" of registry }
    wait "{pathname of system folder & "\msiexec.exe"}" /x "{{AC76BA86-7AD7-1033-7B44-AB0000000001}" /qn /norestart
endif

// *** BEGIN INSTALL OPTIONS
// The default installation is to install Adobe Reader WITHOUT a desktop shortcut.
// To install with a desktop shortcut:
//  - Take the normal action you want to take (e.g., Install/Upgrade, Install/Upgrade if not running, etc.)
//  - Select the "Action Script" tab
//  - Select "Use the following action script"
//  - UNCOMMENT line 25
//  - COMMENT line 28

//install Adobe Reader WITH a desktop shortcut and disable updates
//wait __Download\AdbeRdr_en_US.exe /sAll /l /msi /qn /norestart DISABLE_ARM_SERVICE_INSTALL=1 DISABLE_AIR_SHARE=YES SUPPRESS_APP_LAUNCH=YES EULA_ACCEPT=YES AgreeToLicense=Yes ALLUSERS=1

//install Adobe Reader WITHOUT a desktop shortcut and disable updates
wait __Download\AdbeRdr_en_US.exe /sAll /l /msi /qn /norestart DISABLE_ARM_SERVICE_INSTALL=1 DISABLE_AIR_SHARE=YES SUPPRESS_APP_LAUNCH=YES EULA_ACCEPT=YES AgreeToLicense=Yes ALLUSERS=1 DISABLEDESKTOPSHORTCUT=1 /L*v C:\Windows\Temp\software_reader.log


// *** END INSTALL OPTIONS
]]></ActionScript>
      <SuccessCriteria Option="OriginalRelevance"></SuccessCriteria>
    </DefaultAction>
    <Action ID="Action3993">
      <Description>
        <PreLink></PreLink>
        <Link>Install/upgrade</Link>
        <PostLink>.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell"><![CDATA[//download the Adobe Reader installer
prefetch AdbeRdr_en_US.exe sha1:6a3d5b494b4ed6e11fc7d917afc03eaf05d4a6aa size:50837888 http://ardownload.adobe.com/pub/adobe/reader/win/11.x/11.0.06/en_US/AdbeRdr11006_en_US.exe

//uninstall previous version of Adobe Reader
if  { exists key "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\{AC76BA86-7AD7-1033-7B44-AB0000000001}}" of registry }
    wait "{pathname of system folder & "\msiexec.exe"}" /x "{{AC76BA86-7AD7-1033-7B44-AB0000000001}" /qn /norestart
endif

// *** BEGIN INSTALL OPTIONS
// The default installation is to install Adobe Reader WITHOUT a desktop shortcut.
// To install with a desktop shortcut:
//  - Take the normal action you want to take (e.g., Install/Upgrade, Install/Upgrade if not running, etc.)
//  - Select the "Action Script" tab
//  - Select "Use the following action script"
//  - UNCOMMENT line 22
//  - COMMENT line 25

//install Adobe Reader WITH a desktop shortcut
//wait __Download\AdbeRdr_en_US.exe /sAll /l /msi /qn /norestart EULA_ACCEPT=YES DISABLE_AIR_SHARE=YES SUPPRESS_APP_LAUNCH=YES AgreeToLicense=Yes ALLUSERS=1

//to install Adobe Reader WITHOUT a desktop shortcut
wait __Download\AdbeRdr_en_US.exe /sAll /l /msi /qn /norestart EULA_ACCEPT=YES DISABLE_AIR_SHARE=YES SUPPRESS_APP_LAUNCH=YES AgreeToLicense=Yes ALLUSERS=1 DISABLEDESKTOPSHORTCUT=1 /L*v C:\Windows\Temp\software_reader.log

// *** END INSTALL OPTIONS
]]></ActionScript>
      <SuccessCriteria Option="OriginalRelevance"></SuccessCriteria>
    </Action>
    <Action ID="Action3994">
      <Description>
        <PreLink></PreLink>
        <Link>Install/upgrade</Link>
        <PostLink>&amp;nbsp;only if Reader is not running.</PostLink>
